#. i18n: file: mailtransport.kcfg:46
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (precommand), group (Transport $(transportId))
#: rc.cpp:39
msgid "Command to execute before sending a mail"
msgstr "Befehl, de ehr't Loosstüern vun Nettpost utföhrt warrt"

#. i18n: file: mailtransport.kcfg:51
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (precommand), group (Transport $(transportId))
#: rc.cpp:42
msgid ""
"\n"
"        A command to run locally, prior to sending email.\n"
"        This can be used to set up SSH tunnels, for example.\n"
"        Leave it empty if no command should be run.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        En Befehl, de vör't Loosstüern vun Nettbreven lokaal utföhrt warrt.\n"
"        As Bispill kannst Du Dor en SSH-Tunnel mit opstellen.\n"
"        Wenn Du keen Befehl utföhren wullt, lettst Du dat Feld leddig.\n"
"        "

#. i18n: file: mailtransport.kcfg:54
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (requiresAuthentication), group (Transport $(transportId))
#: rc.cpp:49
msgid "Server requires authentication"
msgstr "Server bruukt Identiteetprööv"

#. i18n: file: mailtransport.kcfg:58
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (requiresAuthentication), group (Transport $(transportId))
#: rc.cpp:52
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Check this option if your SMTP server requires authentication before "
"accepting mail.\n"
"        This is known as 'Authenticated SMTP' or simply ASMTP.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Maak dit an, wenn Dien SMTP-Server de Identiteet pröövt, ehr he "
"Nettbreven annimmt.\n"
"        Dit warrt »Authenticated SMTP« oder eenfach »ASMTP« nöömt.\n"
"        "

#. i18n: file: mailtransport.kcfg:62
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (storePassword), group (Transport $(transportId))
#: rc.cpp:58
msgid "Store password"
msgstr "Passwoort wohren"

#. i18n: file: mailtransport.kcfg:68
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (storePassword), group (Transport $(transportId))
#: rc.cpp:61
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Check this option to have your password stored.\n"
"        \\nIf KWallet is available the password will be stored there which "
"is considered safe.\\n\n"
"        However, if KWallet is not available, the password will be stored in "
"the configuration file.\n"
"        The password is stored in an obfuscated format, but should not be "
"considered secure from decryption efforts if access to the configuration "
"file is obtained.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Maak dit an, wenn Du dat Passwoort wohrt hebben wullt.\n"
"        \\nWenn KWallet verföögbor is, warrt dat Passwoort dor binnen wohrt, "
"wat seker noog is.\\n\n"
"        Wenn de elektroonsche Knipp nich verföögbor is, warrt dat Passwoort "
"binnen de Instellendatei wohrt.\n"
"        Dat steiht dor in en nich leesbor Formaat binnen, man wenn Een de "
"Datei faatkriggt un dat Passwoort redig opslöteln will, is dat Formaat nich "
"seker.\n"
"        "

